<body>
<header>
  <h1>Global Intentional Homicide Trends (1990–2023)</h1>
  <p>A multi-dimensional analysis of UNODC data examining global trajectories, regional disparities, gender imbalances, and age-group vulnerabilities to inform evidence-based public safety policy.</p>
</header>

<div class="container">

<!-- KPI Dashboard -->
<section>
  <h2>Executive Summary</h2>
  <div class="kpi-grid">
    <div class="kpi-card">
